  "prompt": "What does a product that normally costs 199.00 EUR cost during each promotion that starts in 2025? Use the promotions table and keep the promotions with a start_date from 2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31, both included. discount_pct holds the discount in percent: 15.00 means 15 percent off. Return three columns, in this order: promo_code, discount_pct and price_after_eur, the 199.00 EUR price after the promotion's discount, rounded to 2 decimals with ROUND(x, 2). Return one row per promotion. Any row order is fine.",
